{"server":"cn","storyId":"act18d3_level_act18d3_07_end","groupId":"act18d3","stageId":"act18d3_07","title":"守护者","storyCode":"SV-7","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"28832b4a84ba076c6abdc097892d4727747dc5d75930a4ebf7f42da8ad912f0c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"斯卡蒂下定决心，应主教邀请，前去教堂。与此同时，审判官决定炸毁教堂。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibtownn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"今天拿的够多了吧？除了我、佩特拉奶奶、长凳的份......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，还有歌手，歌手还会回来的吧？也不能让她饿肚子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的......还有多。可以存盒子里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，壁炉叔，你想要吗？那、那我还是先给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哇，你胳膊上缠着的这些好像是海藻哎！给我吧，我要试试做歌手教我的......呃，海藻酒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，长凳呢？一晃眼又跑哪里去了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咿呀......啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......歌......啊啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别抓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个给你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别啃。不能吃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"木框，木框......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别叫她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你帮我把琴带给她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉她......不，你没法告诉她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这还不是再见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去问问题。然后，我会自己说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcoastn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，我们现在就要在山体上安置爆破物吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"另一方面，我看见一个人进了教堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"她看起来和我们之前遇见过的那个外来人......很像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"那，长官，她到底是什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈尔人。"},{"type":"narration","text":"。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说了，她和恐鱼战斗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......除了我们之外，竟然还有人知道这些怪物，专门和这些怪物战斗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我们炸毁教堂......她会受到波及吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"不解决首恶，将这里毁灭也无用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"这样吗？所以还是得知道，是谁在这里引起了异象......长官也不能确定吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你不可问你任务之外的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，虽然我知道长官你不在意，但我还是想说说......这个区块的承重结构，承受不住我们设计的爆炸的威力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"南半侧的城市随时都可能塌陷，这里的居民却还不知道这个消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"继续说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我想去疏散他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕他们在长官你看来是古怪的，有问题的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......应该被净化的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"判官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"说出你的职责！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"“我是为了伊比利亚的存续，为了同伊比利亚的敌人而战，为了守卫伊比利亚的洁净与德行，提起了剑与灯！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"那么你必须对他们做出判决！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"判决？判处他们......死刑吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，你上一次听到过去的歌声，是什么时候？那些唱片，都已经坏了吧？你的机器也落灰很久了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我听见那首歌。我听见了这个阿戈尔人给他们唱的歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"那样的歌，是伊比利亚原本该有的歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"在杀死他们以前，我想知道真相。就像长官你想揪出幕后主使者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"也许他们还是会变异，到那时候，我一定会亲手净化他们，但现在我想让他们先去避难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，如果你同意，我立刻就会去进行疏散！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是你的判决？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，我不知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"艾丽妮，你不止在对面前的人下判决。你也在对其他人下判决！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你判决怪物生，就是判决人民死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白！这样的判决，我已经下过许多次！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你的判决，既可能阻绝灾难，也可能带来噩兆！你可能救一人而杀百人，也可能杀百人而救一人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白，长官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"这里面的利害关系，道德和经文的冲突......我都明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"我问你这个了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"我问你的是，艾丽妮，这种责任是你能承担得了的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你会带来痛苦，你就必须也遭受痛苦，而且要比你施加给别人的那些罪恶加起来还要多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你有这种胆识吗？你的信仰会在你遭受内心折磨时动摇吗？如果你失败了，你造成了恶果，你会因此一蹶不振吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......我能承担。我不会动摇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"在我加入审判庭的时候，我就已经这么做了。我能。如果我做错了，那么就让我遭受责罚。我必须做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"长官！我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"可以了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"可以了。现在去履行你的职责，判官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"——是，长官！我立刻就去疏散当地居民！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，长官......经匣里剩下的爆破物应该够炸毁整座盐风城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"如有必要，你的判决将被我废除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"那我去了，老师。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，大审判官阁下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibchurch"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，看看是谁来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"欢迎你，吟游歌手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["？？？"]}]}
